      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, what do you mean by \"a sign of a goblin's mischief\"? I'm just talking about discrepancies in the ledger. I'm looking for actual financial causes, like clerical errors or small-scale fraud. Can we stick to the auditing methodology?",
